<title>UK: Finland sets 200 nln Sfr bond due 2005.</title>
<headline>Finland sets 200 nln Sfr bond due 2005.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF FINLAND</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    24.JUN.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    24.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
